WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:01.917
Shark pack,
I need your help.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.833
It's time for a shark food
taste test!

00:00:06.417 --> 00:00:09.083
That's a no to pickles,
no to chorizo,

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:10.167
no to mac and cheese

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.375
and a no
to the meatball sub.

00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:14.375
Not fish sticks!

00:00:14.458 --> 00:00:17.125
I propose we take a
different approach to food.

00:00:17.208 --> 00:00:19.833
I made this with
my molecular gastronomy kit.

00:00:19.917 --> 00:00:21.292
-Huh?
-Your what?

00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:22.750
Molecular gastronomy.

00:00:22.833 --> 00:00:24.833
It's like cooking
with chemistry.

00:00:24.917 --> 00:00:28.708
This tiny cube tastes just
like a rotisserie chicken.

00:00:28.792 --> 00:00:31.000
It'll be irresistible!

00:00:33.583 --> 00:00:35.750
Not fish sticks.

00:00:35.833 --> 00:00:38.625
Wow, considering sharks will
eat pretty much anything,

00:00:38.708 --> 00:00:40.667
he's really picky.

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:43.833
Don't give up!

00:00:43.917 --> 00:00:46.958
We have one last dish
to try: brussels sprouts.

00:00:47.042 --> 00:00:48.375
Ew!

00:00:49.625 --> 00:00:51.792
No one likes
brussels sprouts.

00:00:52.917 --> 00:00:55.417
I guess this taste test
is as good as over.

00:00:56.958 --> 00:00:58.583
Ooh!

00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:02.875
He… likes them?

00:01:02.958 --> 00:01:05.042
Like them?
I think this is love!

00:01:06.042 --> 00:01:07.875
More, more, more!

00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:10.542
Bam, he loves it!
Where'd you get them?

00:01:10.625 --> 00:01:13.167
From the mega planet
of Brusseltron!

00:01:14.292 --> 00:01:15.333
Just kidding!

00:01:15.417 --> 00:01:17.542
I got them from Mr. Hughball
down at the farmers' market.

00:01:17.625 --> 00:01:19.417
He's a real sprout head
nowadays.

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.875
Oh, that must be why
his garden's so stinky.

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:25.375
Sprouts, sprouts, sprouts!

00:01:25.458 --> 00:01:27.083
Wow, sprouts. We did it!

00:01:27.167 --> 00:01:29.042
And brussels sprouts are
so cheap,

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:31.417
we can buy a ton
with our money, right?

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:32.583
Our money?

00:01:33.917 --> 00:01:35.500
Oh, fine.

00:01:36.583 --> 00:01:38.208
My problems are solved!

00:01:38.292 --> 00:01:42.042
Goodbye fish sticks,
hello brussels sprouts.

00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:45.000
Oops!

00:01:51.417 --> 00:01:53.458
That's the last of them,
Sharkdog.

00:01:57.458 --> 00:01:58.500
Don't worry, bud.

00:01:58.583 --> 00:02:00.083
I'll head
to Mr. Hughball's stall

00:02:00.167 --> 00:02:02.500
to get more sprouts
first thing in the morning.

00:02:03.625 --> 00:02:05.375
-Goodnight.
-Night, Max.

00:02:13.583 --> 00:02:15.583
Sprouts, sprouts!

00:02:16.167 --> 00:02:17.042
Yeah!

00:02:25.708 --> 00:02:26.708
Sprouts!

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.417
Sprouts, sprouts, sprouts!

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:34.583
Sprouts.

00:02:36.333 --> 00:02:37.292
Sprouts.

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:40.042
Yum!

00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:46.125
Intruder alert!

00:02:46.875 --> 00:02:48.875
-Intruder alert?
-Intruder alert.

00:02:50.625 --> 00:02:52.958
My beautiful,
itty-bitty brussels?

00:02:53.042 --> 00:02:55.125
Must be
that blasted raccoon again!

00:02:57.208 --> 00:02:58.792
Hey, raccoon!

00:02:59.375 --> 00:03:02.958
Who's got two thumbs
and is coming for you?

00:03:03.042 --> 00:03:04.500
This guy!

00:03:06.708 --> 00:03:08.333
Where are you?

00:03:11.417 --> 00:03:13.708
Oh, there you are,
you little…

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:19.667
Got you! Over here.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.125
No, over here.

00:03:26.542 --> 00:03:28.250
I can hear you, raccoon!

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:40.708
My beautiful big brussels!

00:03:40.792 --> 00:03:42.792
Oh, I've had it, raccoon!

00:03:42.875 --> 00:03:45.000
This is your
sprout-pocalypse.

00:03:48.917 --> 00:03:49.792
Aha!

00:03:54.833 --> 00:03:55.917
Ah!

00:03:57.083 --> 00:03:58.000
No!

00:04:02.542 --> 00:04:03.708
What was that?

00:04:06.333 --> 00:04:07.208
Got you!

00:04:07.292 --> 00:04:08.458
Uh oh.

00:04:08.542 --> 00:04:10.208
End of the line, raccoon.

00:04:14.833 --> 00:04:15.833
Yeah!

00:04:15.917 --> 00:04:17.458
What? Wh…

00:04:17.542 --> 00:04:18.542
Where'd you go?

00:04:25.208 --> 00:04:26.167
Time to go!

00:04:26.667 --> 00:04:27.833
Mummy…

00:04:36.875 --> 00:04:37.750
Uh oh.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.208
Sharkdog?

00:04:42.208 --> 00:04:44.667
-Oh, honey!
-It wasn't me!

00:04:55.875 --> 00:04:56.833
Max?

00:05:00.083 --> 00:05:01.958
Hi, mum. Hi, dad.

00:05:02.667 --> 00:05:04.667
What is that awful smell?

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:06.833
Why am I suddenly craving
brussels sprouts?

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:10.292
My chemistry
cooking experiment failed.

00:05:10.375 --> 00:05:12.208
Well, exploded.

00:05:12.292 --> 00:05:13.875
It's called…

00:05:13.958 --> 00:05:18.042
mamarnotoponis
glopontopomi.

00:05:18.958 --> 00:05:21.167
It's the newest thing
for chefs like me.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.542
At this time of night?

00:05:23.667 --> 00:05:24.708
Huh?

00:05:30.458 --> 00:05:32.000
Sorry about all this.

00:05:32.083 --> 00:05:34.292
I guess I just wanted
a midnight snack.

00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:35.958
Well, at least
I'm glad to see you

00:05:36.042 --> 00:05:38.250
finally eating
something other than fish.

00:05:38.333 --> 00:05:41.083
Alright.
Bed now! Clean up tomorrow.

